        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 9595/50, 2 inch Round Door Flush Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nOmnia's round flush door pull is pressure mounted into the door for a clean, screwless installation. It has a 2 inch diameter. The Round Door Flush Pull is normally used on lightweight doors and drawers such as those found on cabinets and furniture. The Round Cup Pull can also be used on sliding pocket or barn doors. Choose from 5 finishes.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Flush Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Overall Diameter: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Diameter: 1-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Overall Depth: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Cutout Depth:  13/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection:  3/32\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>** This item is discontinued. Limited quantities available.</b>\r\n</p>",
